				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				25,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(build): update Queue submodule to 1fc9cff\n\nThis updates the Queue dependency to commit 1fc9cff9e6, which brings critical improvements to asynchronous task handling in Mountain's core runtime. The Queue submodule provides foundational concurrency primitives for:\n- Managing extension host communication through Vine IPC\n- Coordinating RPC calls between Track dispatcher and Cocoon\n- Scheduling filesystem operations in River/Sun modules\n\nThis version includes optimizations for batch processing of extension events and reduced contention in AppState access patterns. The update supports Land's performance goals by enabling more efficient resource utilization during concurrent operations between Tauri backend and webview components.",
			"SHA": "f5254f464c06d3401cfbed9dba5f425ba4082ac8"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-05-22T04:43:40Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				25,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(LICENSE): relicense project under CC0 1.0 Universal\n\n- Replaced custom Land Public License (LPL v1.0) with CC0 1.0 Universal public domain dedication\n- Removes copyleft requirements and simplifies third-party usage while aligning with Land's goal to foster open collaboration\n- CC0 enables unrestricted use/modification/distribution by removing copyright barriers, encouraging broader adoption of Land's codebase\n- Maintains attribution through preserved copyright notices while waiving all limitations under copyright law\n- Updated Dependency/Queue submodule to latest version (d64ba38) as part of license change maintenance\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Previous licensing terms under LPL v1.0 no longer apply. All contributions now fall under public domain dedication via CC0.",
			"SHA": "bb8ffc4d2dd79d4325bb966f01bbf8aff2623fd9"
