			"Message": "chore(deps): update Queue submodule to latest commit\n\n- Updates the Queue dependency to commit 20b9ac0 as part of ongoing dependency maintenance\n- Aligns with Land's focus on performance and reliability in IPC (Vine) and process management infrastructure\n- Likely includes optimizations for asynchronous task handling used in Mountain's dispatcher (Track) or Cocoon extension host communication\n- Ensures compatibility with latest upstream improvements that may impact message queuing between core components",
